<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - October 1.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - October 1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Tuesday saw 4,685 fixed-interest, five-year bonds maturing on October 12, 2000 trading at 96.65 zlotys.</p>
<p>Turnover was 5.1 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
